  "summary": "Gitea uses inconsistent repository visibility predicates, and the condition used by some repository-listing endpoints…",
  "details": "Gitea uses inconsistent repository visibility predicates, and the condition used by some repository-listing endpoints admits repositories whose owners are hidden from the viewer. Those listings disclose repository metadata even though direct routes correctly deny access with a 404 response. The issue exposes repository existence and listing information across the intended owner-visibility boundary.",
  "severity": [
    {
      "type": "CVSS_V3",
